 {"id": 1746896, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc11fww.jpg"}], "slug": "myth-of-valderit", "storyline": "Nil is trapped in a cursed village that appears only under the full moon. To escape, he must solve twisted puzzles and uncover hidden secrets. Myth of Valderit is a first-person psychological horror experience. The village is alive. It remembers. And it knows your deepest fears.", "summary": "Myth of Valderit is a psychological horror experience set in the cursed village of Valderit, inspired by the abandoned Catalan village of La Mussara. You wake up as Nil, separated from your friends Julia and Enric, and soon uncover the dark secrets lurking within the village\u2026\n\nThis single-player, first-person experience combines exploration, survival, and puzzle-solving. Nil must endure and remain alive, evading the fanatical devotees of an unimaginable entity.", "themes": [{"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/myth-of-valderit", "videos": [{"id": 174202, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "hQdp7DHbe4I", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hQdp7DHbe4I", "title": "Myth of Valderit -  Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/hQdp7DHbe4I/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}